          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Choosing between a management path and a technology path depends on the work you want to do daily: management rewards coordination, decisions and people skills, technology rewards depth and building, and many careers allow movement between the two if you test both before committing."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Try a small leadership task and a small build task, notice which energises you and read notices for senior roles on both sides."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Ask employers how their technical and management tracks work and how promotion is decided."
          }
        ]
      },
